    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "It has never been explained why university students seem to enjoy practical jokes more than anyone else.",
      "translation": "从来没有人解释过，为什么大学生似乎比任何人都更喜欢开恶作剧。",
      "startTime": 14.21,
      "endTime": 22.7,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "practical",
            "pos": "adj.",
